title: $:/plugins/nikorion/pkm-fields/language/en-GB/

Fields/Prompt: $label$:
Fields/Delete/Hint: Clear the ‘$label$’ field
Fields/Dropdown/Hint: Pick an existing value
Fields/Dropdown/Empty: No value used yet
Fields/Remove/Hint: Remove this value
Fields/Stale/Prefix: The
Fields/Stale/Suffix: do not use this field — clear it

Fields/role/Placeholder: tiddler function
Fields/project/Placeholder: project it belongs to
Fields/project/Dropdown/Hint: Pick an existing project
Fields/project/Dropdown/Empty: No project used yet
Fields/technology/Placeholder: technology mobilised
Fields/technology/Dropdown/Hint: Pick an existing technology
Fields/technology/Dropdown/Empty: No technology used yet
Fields/technology/Remove/Hint: Remove this technology
Fields/equipment/Placeholder: equipment mobilised
Fields/equipment/Dropdown/Hint: Pick an existing piece of equipment
Fields/equipment/Dropdown/Empty: No equipment used yet
Fields/equipment/Remove/Hint: Remove this equipment
Fields/disciplines/Placeholder: discipline
Fields/disciplines/Dropdown/Hint: Pick an existing discipline
Fields/disciplines/Dropdown/Empty: No discipline used yet
Fields/disciplines/Remove/Hint: Remove this discipline
Fields/role/Conflict/Hint: Fields that do not apply to this role still hold a value: $fields$ — clear them or change the role
Fields/role/Conflict/NoRole/Hint: Fields that need a role hold a value: $fields$ — give the tiddler a role or clear them
Fields/status/Stale/Hint: Field reserved for tasks, tasklists and routines — clear it
Fields/status/Stale/NoRole/Hint: Field reserved for tasks, tasklists and routines — give the tiddler one of these roles or clear the field
